%N A401950 Number of unlabeled 2-connected graphs with n vertices in which every edge belongs to a triangle.
%e A401950 For n = 5, one of the six graphs has edge set {12,13,14,15,23,24,25}. Every edge belongs to a triangle: 12 and 13 belong to triangle 123, 14 and 24 to triangle 124, and 15 and 25 to triangle 125. This graph is 2-connected.
%Y A401950 Cf. A396149 (connected graphs with the same property).
